    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your father\u2019s passing, you inherit the apartment he left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a mysterious man appears with a warning for you\u2014the new landlord:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There are Yokai living among the residents in your apartment building.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, your journey to uncover the cleverly disguised Yokai begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yokai Landlord: Monster Mystery!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social deduction adventure where monsters wear human faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a social deduction adventure game where you, as the landlord, must uncover Yokai who are blending in among your apartment\u2019s tenants by gathering clues and presenting evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a single narrative divided into multiple chapters. As you progress, the seasons change, and new tenants\u2014including more Yokai\u2014move in to replace those who were evicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each chapter, you\u2019ll need to identify the Yokai in disguise, gather convincing evidence, and evict them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overarching goal of the game is to uncover why Yokai are infiltrating your apartment\u2014and what motives lie behind the warnings of the mysterious man who appeared before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/e3a65b33cbed7902bf84dc330a9dfe5d.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0dGather information from tenants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your tenants\u2014they\u2019ll come to you, the new landlord, with complaints, requests, or simply to chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These conversations may contain clues that help you identify the Yokai among them. If something sounds off or strange, that might be a hint. Be sure to take notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Use the apartment\u2019s security cameras (Available from Chapter Two)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/f7333b09357db632c988458502252412.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yokai are clever. Even with surveillance cameras, they won\u2019t reveal themselves easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you\u2019re observant, you might catch them doing something not quite human\u2014when they think no one\u2019s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even behavior that seems ordinary at first might hold hidden meaning. Keep your eyes open and leave no clue unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evict the Yokai once discovered</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/15d1b5fc6e6aa8da79c480d30796d6ff.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After gathering enough evidence and identifying a tenant as a Yokai, you can proceed with their eviction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/2330f223784ebb5f7cd92a5f8097e53e.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, simply pointing out the suspicious tenant won\u2019t be enough to make them leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must present evidence\u2014such as proof that the other tenants are human\u2014to convince the Yokai to reveal their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious: if you wrongly evict a human tenant, the remaining residents will become even more suspicious of one another\u2014exactly what the yokai want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview tenants carefully, uncover subtle &quot;suspicious&quot;, and connect the dots to build your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally corner a yokai after rounds of deduction, you\u2019ll experience a unique sense of accomplishment that only this game can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>If you don't evict them in time...</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/862c1c4d09432bff6f70adc23938e4ae.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the night of the new moon, the Yokai will unleash their true power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, there\u2019s nothing us powerless humans can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a mystery game\u2014a heartwarming story of personal growth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Estimated Total Playtime</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About 10 hours</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to \u201cmystery games\u201d, it may take longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're curious about the gameplay, we recommend trying <u>the free demo version</u> first. It includes the full first chapter and tutorial elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Streaming Guidelines</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming guidelines are available on the official website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check them before streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>For those playing on Steam Deck</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enable Proton through Compatibility settings to run the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your father\u2019s passing, you inherit the apartment he left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a mysterious man appears with a warning for you\u2014the new landlord:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There are Yokai living among the residents in your apartment building.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, your journey to uncover the cleverly disguised Yokai begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yokai Landlord: Monster Mystery!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social deduction adventure where monsters wear human faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a social deduction adventure game where you, as the landlord, must uncover Yokai who are blending in among your apartment\u2019s tenants by gathering clues and presenting evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a single narrative divided into multiple chapters. As you progress, the seasons change, and new tenants\u2014including more Yokai\u2014move in to replace those who were evicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each chapter, you\u2019ll need to identify the Yokai in disguise, gather convincing evidence, and evict them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overarching goal of the game is to uncover why Yokai are infiltrating your apartment\u2014and what motives lie behind the warnings of the mysterious man who appeared before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/e3a65b33cbed7902bf84dc330a9dfe5d.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0dGather information from tenants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your tenants\u2014they\u2019ll come to you, the new landlord, with complaints, requests, or simply to chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These conversations may contain clues that help you identify the Yokai among them. If something sounds off or strange, that might be a hint. Be sure to take notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Use the apartment\u2019s security cameras (Available from Chapter Two)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/f7333b09357db632c988458502252412.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yokai are clever. Even with surveillance cameras, they won\u2019t reveal themselves easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you\u2019re observant, you might catch them doing something not quite human\u2014when they think no one\u2019s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even behavior that seems ordinary at first might hold hidden meaning. Keep your eyes open and leave no clue unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evict the Yokai once discovered</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/15d1b5fc6e6aa8da79c480d30796d6ff.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After gathering enough evidence and identifying a tenant as a Yokai, you can proceed with their eviction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/2330f223784ebb5f7cd92a5f8097e53e.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, simply pointing out the suspicious tenant won\u2019t be enough to make them leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must present evidence\u2014such as proof that the other tenants are human\u2014to convince the Yokai to reveal their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious: if you wrongly evict a human tenant, the remaining residents will become even more suspicious of one another\u2014exactly what the yokai want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview tenants carefully, uncover subtle &quot;suspicious&quot;, and connect the dots to build your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally corner a yokai after rounds of deduction, you\u2019ll experience a unique sense of accomplishment that only this game can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>If you don't evict them in time...</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193560/extras/862c1c4d09432bff6f70adc23938e4ae.avif?t=1747028727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the night of the new moon, the Yokai will unleash their true power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, there\u2019s nothing us powerless humans can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a mystery game\u2014a heartwarming story of personal growth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Estimated Total Playtime</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About 10 hours</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to \u201cmystery games\u201d, it may take longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're curious about the gameplay, we recommend trying <u>the free demo version</u> first. It includes the full first chapter and tutorial elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Streaming Guidelines</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming guidelines are available on the official website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check them before streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>For those playing on Steam Deck</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enable Proton through Compatibility settings to run the game.</p>",
